---
// MontanhaB2.astro — Os 5 Estágios Práticos da Sua Fala
// Foco: Clareza sem jargões herméticos, sem prazos mentirosos de meses
import Card from './Card.astro';
---

<section id="metodo-estagios" class="relative py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-background text-foreground">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-primary text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span>Sua Progressão Real</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">
        Os 5 Estágios da Sua Fala: O Que Você Realmente Consegue Fazer
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground-muted">
        Esqueça notas de provas e jargões teóricos. Aqui sua evolução é medida pelo que você é capaz de falar na vida real, acompanhado de perto nas nossas aulas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Lista dos 5 Estágios em Timeline Conectada -->
    <div class="relative space-y-6 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-8 sm:before:left-12 before:w-0.5 before:bg-border before:hidden sm:before:block">
      <!-- Estágio 1 -->
      <Card elevated class="hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Estágio 1</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-background-elevated text-foreground-muted border border-border font-medium">Descongelamento</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-1">Perder o Medo de Falar</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Eliminação da paralisia mental. Você aprende a fazer pedidos em restaurantes, responder saudações, falar sobre sua rotina e destravar as primeiras frases completas sem hesitação.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 shrink-0">
          Início Seguro
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Estágio 2 -->
      <Card elevated class="hover:border-primary/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/20 border border-primary/30 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Estágio 2</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-background-elevated text-foreground-muted border border-border font-medium">Autonomia em Viagens</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-1">Se Virar no Mundo Real</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Resolução de imprevistos em aeroportos, hotéis, compras e transporte no exterior. Você consegue contar acontecimentos simples sem precisar abrir o tradutor no celular a cada minuto.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 shrink-0">
          Autonomia Básica
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Estágio 3 -->
      <Card elevated class="hover:border-accent/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent/20 border border-accent/30 text-accent flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2" />
              <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Estágio 3</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-background-elevated text-foreground-muted border border-border font-medium">Conversação Cotidiana</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-1">Manter um Diálogo Natural</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Bate-papo descontraído sobre trabalho, tecnologia, interesses e opiniões. Você deixa de usar sempre as mesmas 5 palavras e ganha repertório para se expressar com flexibilidade.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-accent px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 shrink-0">
          Fluência Social
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Estágio 4 -->
      <Card elevated class="hover:border-purple-400/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M20 7h-4v-2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" />
              <path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400">Estágio 4</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-background-elevated text-foreground-muted border border-border font-medium">Profissional & Carreira</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-1">Reuniões e Apresentações</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Segurança para participar de reuniões em inglês, explicar ideias técnicas, defender pontos de vista e interagir com colegas internacionais sem suar frio.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 shrink-0">
          Confiança no Trabalho
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Estágio 5 -->
      <Card elevated class="hover:border-pink-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 group">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-pink-500/20 border border-pink-500/30 text-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-inner">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 stroke-current fill-none stroke-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1.5 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-400">Estágio 5</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-background-elevated text-foreground-muted border border-border font-medium">Autonomia Plena</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-1">Expressão Espontânea e Conexão</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
              Improvisação, humor e segurança absoluta ao conversar sobre qualquer assunto em tempo real, testado e lapidado diretamente nas sessões ao vivo com o professor Gabriel Lima.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-pink-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/20 shrink-0">
          Autonomia Real
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
